              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Each market / customer is compared with the whole company on 2 checks: last 6 months vs before, and last 6 months vs the same 6 months a year earlier. Declining / At risk = more than 10 pts below the company on both checks · To watch = on one check · Down with the company = falling like the company · Outperforming = 10 pts above on both · Inactive = no order for 90+ days · Products: one-off loss (3 sales or fewer), recurring loss, margin turned negative, margin falling (-5 pts). Right-click a row → Drill through.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#605e5c",
